The most general integral of the equation (1) which fulfils the conditions (1a) and corresponds to a periodic motion of the string, is ¶ \[\left.\begin{aligned} y = {} & A_1 \,.\, \sin\frac{\pi x}{l} \,.\, \cos 2\pi nt + A_2 \,.\, \sin\frac{2\pi x}{l} \,.\, \cos 4\pi nt \\ & +@@A@@
