 A_3 \,.\, \sin\frac{3\pi x}{l} \,.\, \cos 6\pi nt + \&c. \\ & + B_1 \,.\, \sin\frac{\pi x}{l} \,.\, \sin 2\pi nt + B_2 \,.\, \sin\frac{2\pi x}{l} \,.\, \sin 4\pi nt \\ & + B_3 \,.\, \sin\frac{3\pi x}{l} \,.\, \sin 6\pi nt + \&c. \end{aligned}\right\} \tag{1b}\] where \(n^2 =@@A@@
